  [CHORUS — 1 line — 9 bars of 13/8, three-quarter-beat pickup]
      up to 465 syllables a line after the pickup
  [POSTCHORUS — 1 line — 9 bars of 13/8, half-beat pickup]
      up to 466 syllables a line after the pickup
  [CHORUS — 1 line — 9 bars of 13/8, three-quarter-beat pickup]
      up to 465 syllables a line after the pickup
  [POSTCHORUS — 1 line — 9 bars of 13/8, half-beat pickup]
      up to 466 syllables a line after the pickup
  [VERSE — 4 lines — 36 bars of 13/8, three-quarter-beat pickup]
      up to 465 syllables a line after the pickup
  [CODA — 4 lines — 36 bars of 13/8, half-beat pickup]
      up to 466 syllables a line after the pickup
